    "title": "How many shards?",
    "body": "Each **shard** holds part of the data on its own server. Storage needs 5 TB ÷ 1 TB = 5 shards; writes need 30,000 ÷ 5,000 = 6. The larger number wins: **6 shards**, plus room to grow. Each shard holds about 5 ÷ 6 ≈ 0.8 TB and takes about 5,000 writes per second.",
